      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Is campus-based asthma care meeting students' needs? In this study, we examined asthma severity, impact, and quality of care in a sample of university students. Our research highlights the importance of designing university asthma programs specific to the needs of young adults that follow national asthma guidelines."},
